      "slot": "word",
      "skill": "application",
      "variant": "B",
      "q": "Lerato is twice as old as her brother. In 5 years their ages will add up to 31. How old is Lerato now?",
      "qAf": "Lerato is twee keer so oud as haar broer. Oor 5 jaar sal hul ouderdomme tot 31 optel. Hoe oud is Lerato nou?",
      "options": [
        "7",
        "14",
        "12",
        "16"
      ],
      "optionsAf": [
        "7",
        "14",
        "12",
        "16"
      ],
      "answer": 1,
      "explain": "Let the brother be b, so Lerato is 2b. Then (2b + 5) + (b + 5) = 31, so b = 7 and Lerato is 14.",
      "explainAf": "Laat die broer b wees, dus is Lerato 2b. Dan is (2b + 5) + (b + 5) = 31, dus b = 7 en Lerato is 14."
    },
